es_count)}.\n- Query/extraction errors: ${fmt(analysis.data_quality_gate?.error_count)}.\n- Seven-day completeness uses an effective query interval that accounts for the configured maxDataPoints limit; intentional query downsampling is not treated as missing scrape data.\n${Array.isArray(analysis.data_quality_gate?.error_details) && analysis.data_quality_gate.error_details.length\n  ? `- Error details: ${analysis.data_quality_gate.error_details.map(e => `${e.batch_id || 'batch n/a'} / ${e.metric_key || e.ref_id || 'unknown metric'}: ${e.error || 'unspecified error'}`).join('; ')}`\n  : ''}\n\n## Technical Assessment\n\n${assessment.map((x,i) => `${i+1}. ${x}`).join('\\n')}\n\n## 1. PMM Sharding Capability Matrix\n\n| Capability | Status |\n|---|---|\n${capabilityRows()}\n\n**Sharding-related metric names discovered in PMM inventory:** ${capabilities.discovered_sharding_metric_count}.  \nOnly explicitly modeled low-cardinality signals are analyzed in this workflow; unfamiliar metric names remain capability evidence only.\n\n## 2. Topology: mongos and Replica Sets\n\n### mongos Routers\n${mongosRows()}\n\n### Replica Sets\n${replicaSetRows()}\n\n### Explicitly Labeled Config Server Services\n${configServerServices.length\n  ? configServerServices.map(s =>\n      `- **${s.node_name}** — service ${s.service_name}; replica set ${s.replica_set || 'unresolved'}; role ${s.cl_role || s.cluster_role || 'configsvr'}.`\n    ).join('\\n')\n  : '- No config-server service was explicitly identified by PMM/exporter role labels.'}\n\n## 3. Data Shard and Chunk Distribution\n\n${chunkRows()}\n\n### Current per-shard database dbStats footprint\n\n${shardDataRows.some(x => finite(x.data_size_bytes) !== null || finite(x.storage_size_bytes) !== null)\n  ? `| Shard | dataSize | dataSize share | storageSize | storageSize share | indexSize | Objects |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n${shardDataRows.map(x =>\n  `| ${x.shard} | ${fmtBytes(x.data_size_bytes)} | ${fmt(x.data_size_share_pc